WEBVTT

00:25.108 --> 00:26.067
Why?

00:29.612 --> 00:31.656
Why did this happen?

00:34.492 --> 00:35.827
Nezuko, don't die on me.

00:35.910 --> 00:36.828
Don't die.

00:39.164 --> 00:41.082
I'll definitely save you!

00:43.418 --> 00:44.502
I won't let you die.

00:46.254 --> 00:50.091
I'll definitely save you!

01:02.812 --> 01:03.855
Tanjiro.

01:07.400 --> 01:09.110
Your face is dirty.

01:09.778 --> 01:10.987
Come over here.

01:13.823 --> 01:15.742
It gets dangerous because of the snow.

01:15.867 --> 01:17.494
It's okay if you don't go.

01:18.411 --> 01:22.624
I want everyone to be full
during New Year.

01:23.166 --> 01:25.168
I want to sell more charcoal.

01:26.252 --> 01:27.504
Thank you.

01:29.547 --> 01:30.590
Tanjiro!

01:32.509 --> 01:34.093
Are you going to the town today?

01:34.177 --> 01:35.887
I want to tag along too!

01:37.931 --> 01:38.890
You can't.

01:39.265 --> 01:41.976
You both can't walk
as fast as Tanjiro, right?

01:42.310 --> 01:43.603
Mom!

01:43.853 --> 01:44.854
No way.

01:45.271 --> 01:47.732
We can't pull the carriage out today.

01:47.982 --> 01:50.777
You can't sit and rest on it.

01:53.279 --> 01:54.614
Tanjiro!

01:56.116 --> 01:57.700
I want to go with you.

01:58.284 --> 02:00.203
I'll help you sell the charcoal too.

02:01.287 --> 02:02.622
Thank you, Hanako.

02:03.498 --> 02:05.708
But you should stay home today.

02:09.337 --> 02:10.338
Shigeru too.

02:10.547 --> 02:13.424
I'll buy delicious food for you.

02:13.675 --> 02:14.676
Really?

02:14.926 --> 02:15.844
Yes.

02:17.720 --> 02:20.682
Hanako, I'll read a book to you
when I return home.

02:20.932 --> 02:21.808
Okay.

02:22.058 --> 02:23.017
Good girl.

02:23.393 --> 02:25.311
Thank you, Tanjiro.

02:26.855 --> 02:28.231
I'll get going then.

02:28.940 --> 02:29.816
Takeo.

02:30.066 --> 02:34.028
If you don't mind,
can you chop some firewood for me?

02:34.571 --> 02:36.781
I can chop the firewood.

02:37.824 --> 02:40.243
I just want to do it with you.

02:42.620 --> 02:43.830
Good boy.

02:43.913 --> 02:45.331
What are you doing?

02:45.415 --> 02:47.000
Takeo is embarrassed!

02:47.083 --> 02:48.459
Shut up!

02:48.543 --> 02:49.752
Good boy.

02:49.836 --> 02:51.546
Don't touch my head!

02:56.551 --> 02:58.720
Come back quickly!

02:59.387 --> 03:01.097
Be careful on the road!

03:06.811 --> 03:07.770
Tanjiro.

03:08.938 --> 03:09.981
Nezuko.

03:10.440 --> 03:12.567
I put Rokuta to sleep.

03:13.318 --> 03:14.777
Or else, he'll cry and make noise.

03:15.778 --> 03:18.489
I think he's feeling lonely
after Dad's passing.

03:20.658 --> 03:24.162
That's why everyone clings to you.

03:26.789 --> 03:28.082
Come back safely!

03:31.419 --> 03:33.463
Living isn't easy.

03:34.172 --> 03:35.506
But we're happy.

03:36.507 --> 03:39.552
But life is like the weather.

03:40.762 --> 03:43.181
It's ever-changing.

03:44.265 --> 03:46.392
Sunny days won't last forever.

03:46.935 --> 03:49.354
It won't keep on snowing too.

03:50.396 --> 03:54.359
But when happiness comes crashing down,

03:54.817 --> 03:55.944
it's always

03:56.945 --> 03:58.529
accompanied by the smell of blood.

04:07.664 --> 04:09.540
It's Tanjiro.

04:09.832 --> 04:12.418
You still came down the mountain
in this weather?

04:12.627 --> 04:14.504
You're so hardworking.

04:14.963 --> 04:16.422
Don't catch a cold.

04:16.798 --> 04:18.174
I'm fine with this weather.

04:18.466 --> 04:19.676
Want to buy some charcoal?

04:19.759 --> 04:20.927
Do you have enough at home?

04:21.219 --> 04:22.845
Hey, Tanjiro!

04:24.097 --> 04:25.598
I want to buy charcoal.

04:26.099 --> 04:29.435
You helped me fix my door last time.
Thank you.

04:29.727 --> 04:31.562
I also want to buy charcoal.

04:35.692 --> 04:39.070
Tanjiro! You came at the right time.

04:40.071 --> 04:42.865
I was treated as the culprit
who broke the plate.

04:43.032 --> 04:44.450
Please help me!

04:44.701 --> 04:45.743
Smell it.

04:50.498 --> 04:52.041
I smelled a cat.

04:52.500 --> 04:53.710
I told you!

04:53.835 --> 04:55.712
My goodness, it was the cat's fault.

04:55.795 --> 04:57.672
I told you that it wasn't me!

04:58.089 --> 04:59.340
Tanjiro.

04:59.424 --> 05:02.927
Could you help me move some stuff?

05:07.432 --> 05:09.350
It's already late.

05:10.351 --> 05:12.812
But thank goodness,
I sold all the charcoal.

05:14.564 --> 05:15.648
Tanjiro!

05:17.817 --> 05:19.777
Are you going back to the mountain?

05:20.445 --> 05:21.779
It's too dangerous. Don't go.

05:22.322 --> 05:24.699
I have a good nose. I'll be fine.

05:25.658 --> 05:27.285
You can stay the night here.

05:27.535 --> 05:28.369
Come.

05:28.494 --> 05:29.537
Come here.

05:30.663 --> 05:31.706
But...

05:31.789 --> 05:33.124
Just come.

05:34.250 --> 05:35.877
The demons are coming out.

05:50.099 --> 05:51.267
Thank you for the meal.

05:56.189 --> 05:58.232
Well, Mr. Saburo.

05:58.775 --> 06:00.318
What do you mean by demons?

06:01.611 --> 06:05.364
Since a long time ago, man-eating demons
always come out after sunset.

06:08.367 --> 06:11.537
So, you mustn't wander outside at night.

06:12.330 --> 06:13.581
Sleep after you're done.

06:13.831 --> 06:15.833
Wake up early tomorrow and go home.

06:20.546 --> 06:24.675
The demons can't enter houses, right?

06:25.676 --> 06:28.096
No, they can.

06:31.849 --> 06:35.228
If so, everyone will be eaten
by the demons.

06:38.147 --> 06:41.818
That's why there are demon slayers
who help us to kill them.

06:42.235 --> 06:43.611
They have existed a long time ago.

06:45.947 --> 06:47.448
I'll put the light out.

06:47.782 --> 06:48.950
Go to sleep.

06:52.203 --> 06:56.249
Mr. Saburo's whole family passed away.
He has been living alone.

06:56.582 --> 06:57.875
He must be lonely.

06:59.127 --> 07:01.254
I'll bring my brothers here next time.

07:02.046 --> 07:03.381
There's nothing to be afraid of.

07:03.464 --> 07:04.715
There are no demons in this world.

07:05.049 --> 07:06.175
Everything will be fine.

07:07.176 --> 07:09.053
But come to think of it,

07:09.762 --> 07:13.349
Grandma said similar things
before she passed away.

07:19.480 --> 07:20.815
Be careful on the road.

07:31.242 --> 07:33.119
When happiness comes crashing down,

07:34.078 --> 07:35.121
it's always...

07:42.503 --> 07:43.838
The smell of blood.

08:07.278 --> 08:08.279
Nezuko!

08:09.030 --> 08:10.072
What's wrong?

08:10.239 --> 08:11.574
What happened?

08:12.325 --> 08:13.701
What happened here?

08:20.124 --> 08:21.167
Mom.

08:28.466 --> 08:29.467
Mom.

08:29.800 --> 08:30.801
Hanako.

08:31.761 --> 08:32.762
Takeo.

08:33.346 --> 08:34.305
Shigeru.

08:35.306 --> 08:36.516
Nezuko.

08:36.766 --> 08:37.725
Rokuta.

08:46.275 --> 08:48.236
Only Nezuko's body feels warm.

08:49.820 --> 08:51.781
If I take her to the doctor,
maybe she can be saved.

08:52.698 --> 08:54.659
Why did this happen?

08:56.077 --> 08:57.203
Was it a bear?

08:57.370 --> 08:59.539
Did the non-hibernating bear come out?

09:06.045 --> 09:07.672
I can't breathe.

09:08.005 --> 09:10.508
Breathing in the cold air
is hurting my lungs.

09:11.384 --> 09:12.927
I must move forward.

09:13.302 --> 09:15.221
I need to walk faster.

09:16.264 --> 09:18.474
It's still a long way from the town.

09:18.683 --> 09:19.725
I need to hurry.

09:20.643 --> 09:22.353
I can't let Nezuko die.

09:25.147 --> 09:26.607
I'll definitely save you.

09:27.567 --> 09:29.485
I will save you!

09:38.202 --> 09:39.161
Damn it!

09:47.920 --> 09:50.631
The snow saved me.

09:51.757 --> 09:53.509
But I slipped because of the snow too.

09:55.469 --> 09:56.512
Nezuko.

10:02.977 --> 10:05.229
Nezuko, are you okay?

10:06.606 --> 10:07.898
You don't have to walk.

10:08.190 --> 10:10.151
I'll piggyback you to the town.

10:11.193 --> 10:12.236
Nezuko!

10:21.662 --> 10:23.372
This is...

10:24.498 --> 10:25.625
a demon.

10:27.084 --> 10:29.837
Now I remember what Mr. Saburo said.

10:31.422 --> 10:33.174
Nezuko is a man-eating demon.

10:33.758 --> 10:34.842
It can't be.

10:34.925 --> 10:36.093
Nezuko is a human.

10:36.177 --> 10:37.595
She's a human since she was born.

10:38.554 --> 10:42.016
But she doesn't smell
like the usual Nezuko.

10:43.392 --> 10:45.436
No, Nezuko didn't do that

10:46.020 --> 10:48.230
because she protected Rokuta
and fell on the ground.

10:48.481 --> 10:51.025
Her mouth and hands
weren't stained with blood.

10:51.901 --> 10:53.361
Plus, there's another...

10:53.611 --> 10:55.237
Another smell.

11:00.409 --> 11:02.662
Nezuko's body is growing bigger!

11:04.538 --> 11:06.374
She's getting stronger too.

11:07.541 --> 11:10.086
When I was sleeping comfortably
in someone else's house,

11:10.503 --> 11:12.838
everyone was experiencing
a terrible incident.

11:13.672 --> 11:14.965
It must have hurt.

11:15.383 --> 11:16.634
It must have been horrible.

11:18.260 --> 11:20.721
I'm sorry for not saving everyone.

11:22.306 --> 11:24.934
But at the very least,
I can do something for Nezuko.

11:25.226 --> 11:27.103
But she's so strong.

11:27.186 --> 11:28.354
I can't fight back.

11:29.188 --> 11:30.356
Nezuko!

11:30.648 --> 11:32.149
You can do it, Nezuko!

11:32.400 --> 11:35.277
Endure it! Do it for me!

11:36.904 --> 11:38.614
Don't become a demon!

11:38.781 --> 11:40.241
Hang in there!

11:40.366 --> 11:43.828
You can do it!

12:16.110 --> 12:17.236
What happened?

12:21.615 --> 12:22.658
Who are you?

12:27.371 --> 12:28.205
A katana?

12:28.289 --> 12:29.165
DESTROY DEMONS

12:29.790 --> 12:31.000
Why did you protect her?

12:31.542 --> 12:32.668
My younger sister.

12:32.835 --> 12:34.295
She's my younger sister!

12:37.548 --> 12:38.716
Nezuko!

12:42.553 --> 12:44.472
Is that your sister?

13:00.571 --> 13:01.489
Nezuko!

13:01.572 --> 13:02.573
Don't move.

13:06.577 --> 13:09.163
My job is slaying vile demons.

13:09.580 --> 13:12.541
Of course, I also need
to chop off your sister's head.

13:13.209 --> 13:14.418
Hang on.

13:14.627 --> 13:16.378
Nezuko didn't kill anyone.

13:17.505 --> 13:21.592
My house has another smell
that I have never smelled before.

13:22.176 --> 13:23.302
It killed everyone.

13:23.552 --> 13:26.013
I think that must be the case!

13:26.430 --> 13:27.973
It wasn't Nezuko!

13:28.516 --> 13:31.060
Although I don't know
why she become like this,

13:31.936 --> 13:32.895
but...

13:33.521 --> 13:34.939
The reason is simple.

13:35.606 --> 13:39.276
When the demon's blood touches
her wound, she'll become a demon.

13:40.528 --> 13:42.988
That's how man-eating demons
grow their numbers.

13:43.989 --> 13:46.075
Nezuko won't eat people!

13:46.742 --> 13:48.285
I can't believe you said that.

13:48.619 --> 13:51.789
Weren't you almost eaten by her?

13:52.790 --> 13:53.749
No!

13:53.999 --> 13:56.377
Nezuko definitely recognized me.

13:57.086 --> 13:58.963
I won't let anyone hurt her.

13:59.380 --> 14:01.298
Nezuko will become a human again.

14:01.632 --> 14:03.259
I'll definitely cure her!

14:03.968 --> 14:05.177
She's hopeless.

14:05.636 --> 14:08.847
After she becomes a demon,
she can't become a human again.

14:09.390 --> 14:10.391
I'll find it!

14:10.558 --> 14:12.518
I'll definitely find a way.

14:13.185 --> 14:14.895
Don't kill her!

14:15.396 --> 14:18.065
I'll find the one who killed my family.

14:18.315 --> 14:20.693
I'll do all the above!

14:20.776 --> 14:21.944
So...

14:22.444 --> 14:23.654
So...

14:23.946 --> 14:25.948
Don't kill her!

14:26.240 --> 14:29.243
Don't take my family away from me again.

14:31.453 --> 14:32.872
Please stop it.

14:33.956 --> 14:37.710
Please don't kill Nezuko.

14:38.752 --> 14:40.004
I'm begging you.

14:41.547 --> 14:42.965
Please.

14:51.599 --> 14:54.852
Don't let another person take control
of your right to live or die!

14:56.478 --> 14:58.981
Don't beg others pitifully!

14:59.231 --> 15:03.360
If doing so works,
your family wouldn't have been murdered.

15:03.986 --> 15:05.779
When that right is being taken away,

15:05.905 --> 15:08.782
the weak who can't take control
want to cure his younger sister

15:08.866 --> 15:10.492
and find the culprit?

15:11.118 --> 15:12.661
What a joke!

15:12.912 --> 15:16.206
The weak don't have rights or choices.

15:16.332 --> 15:20.002
Even if you go all out,
you'll fall into the hands of the strong.

15:20.294 --> 15:24.006
Maybe the demons will know
the method to cure your sister.

15:24.381 --> 15:29.470
But don't dream that the demons
will respect your will and request.

15:29.803 --> 15:32.389
Of course, I also won't respect you.

15:32.681 --> 15:33.974
This is the reality.

15:34.266 --> 15:37.061
Why did you let her push you
to the ground just now?

15:37.311 --> 15:39.355
Were you protecting your sister?

15:39.688 --> 15:41.649
Why didn't you swing your ax?

15:41.857 --> 15:43.692
Why did you turn your back against me?

15:44.109 --> 15:46.737
Your sister was taken
because of your failure.

15:47.071 --> 15:50.324
I should have pierced you and your sister.

15:53.452 --> 15:54.620
Don't cry.

15:55.037 --> 15:56.413
Don't lose hope.

15:56.789 --> 15:58.874
You shouldn't be doing those things now.

16:00.000 --> 16:02.544
I know you can't take the blow again.

16:03.128 --> 16:04.588
Your family was murdered.

16:04.672 --> 16:06.340
Your sister become a man-eating demon.

16:06.632 --> 16:07.675
Are you hurt?

16:08.384 --> 16:09.927
Do you want to scream your heart out?

16:11.095 --> 16:12.262
I understand.

16:13.305 --> 16:16.392
If I arrived here half a day earlier,

16:16.684 --> 16:19.269
maybe your family wouldn't have to die.

16:20.062 --> 16:23.565
But I can't turn back the time.

16:24.692 --> 16:25.651
Unleash your fury.

16:26.318 --> 16:28.946
The powerful and pure rage
of unforgiveness

16:29.029 --> 16:32.324
will become an unwavering force
driving your limbs.

16:33.075 --> 16:34.827
A fragile will

16:35.411 --> 16:38.122
won't be able to protect
and cure your sister

16:38.414 --> 16:41.458
or avenge your family.

16:41.542 --> 16:42.459
Stop...

16:44.753 --> 16:46.338
Stop it!

17:00.978 --> 17:03.897
A simple attack driven by emotions.

17:04.148 --> 17:05.149
How dumb.

17:19.955 --> 17:21.081
Where's his ax?

17:30.340 --> 17:32.593
Before running into the woods,

17:33.552 --> 17:35.304
not only did he threw a rock,

17:35.596 --> 17:38.474
but he also threw his ax.

17:39.808 --> 17:41.977
To avoid being discovered he was unarmed,

17:42.269 --> 17:44.772
he slanted his body
so that I couldn't see his hand.

17:46.148 --> 17:48.525
He knew he couldn't beat me.

17:49.735 --> 17:53.238
He wanted to knock me down
when I slashed at him.

17:54.615 --> 17:55.949
This guy...

18:00.996 --> 18:01.997
Damn it!

18:02.164 --> 18:03.082
He'll be eaten!

18:07.878 --> 18:09.046
Nezuko.

18:12.883 --> 18:14.426
Nezuko is different.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.472
She won't eat people!

18:22.184 --> 18:25.479
Someone said the same thing back then.

18:25.562 --> 18:27.564
He was eaten in the end.

18:28.440 --> 18:30.400
In the state of hunger,

18:30.776 --> 18:33.112
demons will eat their family members

18:34.029 --> 18:35.864
because they have high nutrition values.

18:36.698 --> 18:39.451
Who knows how many times
have I seen this scene?

18:40.953 --> 18:43.288
This girl is wounded.

18:43.914 --> 18:46.834
She's using energy to heal herself.

18:47.417 --> 18:48.752
When she became a demon,

18:48.961 --> 18:51.255
she must have consumed a lot of energy.

18:51.839 --> 18:54.967
Without a doubt,
she's in a state of severe hunger.

18:56.343 --> 19:00.347
She can't wait
to eat human flesh right now.

19:01.306 --> 19:02.766
Her protective action.

19:03.183 --> 19:05.060
Her intimidation towards me.

19:08.105 --> 19:13.318
Maybe this pair of siblings
are different after all.

19:30.794 --> 19:33.088
I'm sorry for leaving you behind.

19:33.422 --> 19:34.548
Tanjiro.

19:35.757 --> 19:37.885
I'm leaving Nezuko in your hands.

19:49.605 --> 19:50.689
Are you awake?

19:54.109 --> 19:56.236
Go to the foot of Sagiri Mountain.

19:56.570 --> 19:59.156
Find an old man called Sakonji Urokodaki.

20:00.741 --> 20:03.410
Tell him that Giyu Tomioka sent you.

20:04.912 --> 20:07.873
There's no sunlight now so she's fine.

20:08.498 --> 20:10.959
But don't bring her out in the sun.

20:28.518 --> 20:29.519
Let's go.

23:36.414 --> 23:38.416
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
